---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Why Freedom On Own Terms exists: helping everyday people keep up with AI and use it on their own terms.">
  <section class="container page-head">
    <h1>About <span class="gradient-text">Freedom On Own Terms</span></h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container prose">
    <p>
      AI is changing how we work, create, and live, and it's moving fast. New models, tools, and headlines arrive every day,
      and it's hard to tell what matters.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Freedom On Own Terms</strong> cuts through the noise. We bring together the latest AI news from trusted sources,
      curate the tools that are genuinely useful, and publish practical guides that show you how to use them.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>AI news:</strong> headlines from leading tech publications and AI labs, updated daily.</li>
      <li><strong>Tools directory:</strong> hand-picked AI tools organized by what you want to get done.</li>
      <li><strong>Guides:</strong> step-by-step, jargon-free articles on using AI in real life.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Our belief</h2>
    <p>
      Technology should give you more freedom, not less. Learn AI at your own pace, choose the tools that fit your
      goals, and use them on your own terms.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/contact/" class="btn primary">Get in touch</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
